WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.842
Wide pivot columns are part of the schema If the
categories are stable

00:00:05.987 --> 00:00:11.680
that is manageable If new products or diagnoses
appear frequently the

00:00:11.707 --> 00:00:17.629
SQL must change to add columns Long form handles
dynamic categories

00:00:17.655 --> 00:00:23.167
more naturally because new categories become new
rows Often a BI

00:00:23.193 --> 00:00:26.417
tool can create the presentation matrix from long
data
